From f37a567ca32c8c30e718920e330798c303ed9ffe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:31:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(booking): serialize booking creation with an advisory
 lock and relax test timeouts

Concurrent multi-row inserts racing on the no_overlap exclusion constraint
could stall the seven-a-side concurrency test in CI. Booking and block
creation now take a transaction-level advisory lock first, so only one
transaction picks zones at a time; the constraint remains the final guard.
Also raise Prisma transaction maxWait/timeout and Vitest test/hook timeouts.
